msgstr "按钮文字"

msgid "Quick copy"
msgstr "一键复制"

msgid "A text snippet the reader copies with one click."
msgstr "供读者一键复制的文本片段。"

msgid "The Afdian API is unreachable — try again later."
msgstr "爱发电接口暂时无法访问，请稍后再试。"

msgid "Afdian rejected the request (expired timestamp) — check this server's clock."
msgstr "爱发电拒绝了请求（时间戳过期），请检查本服务器时钟。"

msgid "Afdian rejected the request — check the Afdian user id and API token on the payments settings page."
msgstr "爱发电拒绝了请求，请检查支付设置页中的爱发电用户 ID 与 API Token。"

msgid "No matching Afdian order — check the order number."
msgstr "没有匹配的爱发电订单，请核对订单号。"

msgid "This order is not a paid trade."
msgstr "该订单不是已支付的交易。"

msgid "This order's Afdian plan is not bound to a membership tier."
msgstr "该订单对应的爱发电方案未绑定会员档位。"

msgid "This order is bound to another account."
msgstr "该订单已绑定其他账号。"

msgid "The membership activation failed — try again."
msgstr "会员激活失败，请重试。"

msgid "This order has already been activated."
msgstr "该订单已经激活过。"

msgid "The membership is being updated — try again."
msgstr "会员状态正在更新中，请重试。"

msgid "Membership settings"
msgstr "会员设置"

msgid "Disabled tiers stay out of the purchase list; existing holders keep their membership."
msgstr "停用的档位不出现在购买列表；已有持有者的会员不受影响。"

msgid "Afdian (platform push)"
msgstr "爱发电（平台推送）"

msgid "Afdian integration"
msgstr "爱发电集成"

msgid "Activates memberships from Afdian: signed webhook pushes and the order-number self-service check. Bind the Afdian plan below to one local tier."
msgstr "通过爱发电激活会员：签名 webhook 推送与订单号自助核验。需将下方的爱发电方案绑定到一个本地档位。"

msgid "Afdian plan ID"
msgstr "爱发电方案 ID"

msgid "The plan_id this membership binds to; orders paid for it auto-activate the bound tier. Leave empty to keep Afdian unbound."
msgstr "会员绑定的 plan_id；该方案支付的订单会自动激活绑定的档位。留空则不绑定爱发电。"

msgid "Bound membership tier"
msgstr "绑定的会员档位"

msgid "The tier (from the membership settings page) that the Afdian plan activates."
msgstr "爱发电方案所激活的档位（来自会员设置页）。"

msgid "Afdian user id"
msgstr "爱发电用户 ID"

msgid "Afdian API token"
msgstr "爱发电 API Token"

msgid "Afdian webhook address"
msgstr "爱发电 Webhook 地址"

msgid "Register this address in the Afdian creator console (开发工具 > WebHook): {site url}/wp-json/aiya/sponsorship/v1/afdian/callback — POST only."
msgstr "在爱发电创作者后台（开发工具 > WebHook）登记该地址：{site url}/wp-json/aiya/sponsorship/v1/afdian/callback，仅接受 POST。"

msgid "These tiers still have active members and cannot be deleted: %s."
msgstr "以下档位仍有生效中的会员，无法删除：%s。"

msgid "Everyone"
msgstr "所有人"

msgid "The post reads like any other published post."
msgstr "与其他已发布文章一样可读。"

msgid "Logged-in users"
msgstr "登录用户"

msgid "Guests see neither the post in lists nor its body; any signed-in account qualifies."
msgstr "访客在列表与正文中都看不到该文章；任何登录账号均可查看。"

msgid "Members only"
msgstr "仅限会员"

msgid "Only active sponsors (and editors) get past the gate."
msgstr "仅生效中的赞助者（及编辑）可通过门禁。"

msgid "Default post cover"
msgstr "默认文章封面"

msgid "Hero cover shown on article pages when the post has no featured image of its own (auto-cropped to the article banner ratio)."
msgstr "文章页在文章没有自己的特色图时展示的头部封面（自动裁剪为文章横幅比例）。"

msgid "Please log in to interact."
msgstr "登录后才能点赞或评分。"

msgid "Reserved for the front-end resource panel (shown when a resource does not describe its attachments once that wiring lands)."
msgstr "预留给前台资源面板（待该接线落地后，在资源未描述其附件时显示）。"

msgid "Reserved for the front-end resource panel (B3 wiring)."
msgstr "预留给前台资源面板（B3 接线）。"
